{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54057","headline":"呈云岩偈 · 良价","name":"呈云岩偈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"也大奇，也大奇（《祖堂集》作「可笑奇，可笑奇」），无情解说（《五灯会元》作「说法」）不思议。\n若将耳听声不现（《五灯会元》作「终难会」），眼处闻声始可知（《祖堂集》、《五灯会元》作「方得知」。\n）（见《景德传灯录》卷十五、《五灯会元》卷十三）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"良价","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54057.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54057","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}